
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetAttachedList(ID: uuid): {any}`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`list llGetAttachedList(key ID);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a list of object keys corresponding to public attachments worn by an <b>avatar</b> in the order they were attached.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>key</span></td>
          <td>ID / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/avatar" target="_blank">avatar</a></td>
          <td>avatar <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a> that is in the same <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Region" target="_blank">region</a></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>attachments</li>
        <li>avatar</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">523</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>By design HUD attachment keys are not reported by this function.</p>
  <p>If avatar is a child agent, ["NOT ON REGION"] is returned.</p>
  <p>If avatar is not a main agent and not a child agent or not an agent at all, ["NOT FOUND"] is returned.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <p>When an avatar first arrives in a region, there is a brief period when their attachments are not yet fully rezzed or added. During this time, those attachments will not appear in the results.</p>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

-- Touch to list all attachments

function LLEvents.touch_start(events)
    local total_number = #events
    local AttachedNames = {}
    local AttachedUUIDs = ll.GetAttachedList(ll.DetectedKey(0))
    local i = 0
    while i < #AttachedUUIDs do
        local temp = ll.GetObjectDetails(ll.List2Key(AttachedUUIDs, i), {OBJECT_NAME})
        AttachedNames = ll.ListInsertList(AttachedNames, {ll.List2String(temp, 0)}, #AttachedNames)
        i += 1
    end
    ll.Say(PUBLIC_CHANNEL, "\n" .. ll.DumpList2String(AttachedNames, "\n"))
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`// Touch to list all attachments

default
{
    touch_start(integer total_number)
    {
        list AttachedNames;
        list AttachedUUIDs = llGetAttachedList(llDetectedKey(0));
        integer i;
        while (i < llGetListLength(AttachedUUIDs) )
        {
            list temp = llGetObjectDetails(llList2Key(AttachedUUIDs,i),[OBJECT_NAME]);
            AttachedNames += [llList2String(temp,0)];
            ++i;
        }
        llSay(PUBLIC_CHANNEL,"\n" + llDumpList2String(AttachedNames,"\n"));
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
